 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "AI 也被用来骗人。",
   "spoken": "AI 也被用来骗人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 1.7,
   "speechEnd": 3.151
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "深度伪造，是用 AI 生成的伪造视频、图像或语音。",
   "spoken": "深度伪造，是用 AI 生成的伪造视频、图像或语音。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 3.58,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 3.58,
   "speechEnd": 8.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "2024 年 10 月，香港警方拘捕了一个诈骗集团的 27 人。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 10 月，香港警方拘捕了一个诈骗集团的 27 人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 9.24,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 9.346,
   "speechEnd": 14.151
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "他们在视频通话里用换脸技术假扮女性，引导受害者在假平台上投资，涉案超过 3.6 亿港元。",
   "spoken": "他们在视频通话里用换脸技术假扮女性，引导受害者在假平台上投资，涉案超过 3.6 亿港元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 14.58,
   "dur": 9.28,
   "speechStart": 14.58,
   "speechEnd": 23.653
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "2025 年 6 月，一家加密基金会的员工，在假 Zoom 会议里，看到了公司高管的伪造形象。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 6 月，一家加密基金会的员工，在假 Zoom 会议里，看到了公司高管的伪造形象。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 24.08,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 24.184,
   "speechEnd": 32.213
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "对方说麦克风有问题，让他安装一个扩展，实际是恶意脚本。",
   "spoken": "对方说麦克风有问题，让他安装一个扩展，实际是恶意脚本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 32.62,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 32.713,
   "speechEnd": 37.529
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "Huntress 高置信度归因于朝鲜相关组织。",
   "spoken": "Huntress 高置信度归因于朝鲜相关组织。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 37.96,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 37.96,
   "speechEnd": 41.507
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "开户审核也被盯上了。",
   "spoken": "开户审核也被盯上了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 41.94,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 42.035,
   "speechEnd": 43.735
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "虚拟摄像头注入和换脸，被用来绕过 KYC 的活体检测。",
   "spoken": "虚拟摄像头注入和换脸，被用来绕过 KYC 的活体检测。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 44.16,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 44.16,
   "speechEnd": 48.894
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "iProov 和 Sumsub 的厂商报告都显示，这类欺诈在增长。",
   "spoken": "iProov 和 Sumsub 的厂商报告都显示，这类欺诈在增掌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 49.26,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 49.356,
   "speechEnd": 53.602
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "钓鱼文案也变了，更自然，语言更多，迭代更快。",
   "spoken": "钓鱼文案也变了，更自然，语言更多，迭代更快。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 54.04,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 54.137,
   "speechEnd": 58.004
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "靠读文案判断真假，已经不可靠。",
   "spoken": "靠读文案判断真假，已经不可靠。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 58.42,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 58.42,
   "speechEnd": 61.376
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "Chainalysis 统计，2025 年诈骗损失已确认约 140 亿美元，估算约 170 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "Chainalysis 统计，2025 年诈骗损失已确认约 140 亿美元，估算约 170 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 61.84,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 61.84,
   "speechEnd": 69.371
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "和 AI 服务供应商有链上关联的诈骗团伙，平均获利约是无关联团伙的 4.5 倍。",
   "spoken": "和 AI 服务公应商有链上关联的诈骗团伙，平均获利约是无关联团伙的 4.5 倍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 69.82,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 69.82,
   "speechEnd": 77.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "AI 抬高的，是单起诈骗的获利能力。",
   "spoken": "AI 抬高的，是单起诈骗的获利能力。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 77.8,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 77.906,
   "speechEnd": 80.71
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "所以防御要回到流程。",
   "spoken": "所以防御要回到流程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
